    "updated_at": "2024-02-09T09:12:26Z",
    "body": "> These match on details, dialog, and select elements since they can be in an open or closed state.\r\n\r\nHas it been discussed whether they should match other pickers besides select, like color pickers, date pickers, etc.? Basically all the things that showPicker() triggers.",
