    "created_at": "2024-02-09T20:15:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-02-09T20:15:01Z",
    "body": "> Has it been discussed whether they should match other pickers besides select, like color pickers, date pickers, etc.? Basically all the things that showPicker() triggers.\r\n\r\nThat sounds great! I just used it on the elements that the css spec listed, but I don't see any reason why we shouldn't support `<input>` as well.\r\n\r\nI think this might get nuanced even more than `<select>` since some browsers have popups for date/time input types and others don't. How should I proceed?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
