    "created_at": "2024-02-20T15:23:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-02-20T15:23:29Z",
    "body": "> I'd be interested to hear more about this, is there a conversation you can point to?\r\n\r\nAbsolutely, so there's an open issue regarding lack of feature detection for showPicker() [here](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/7790) and that links to a TAG design review comment [here](https://github.com/w3ctag/design-reviews/issues/688#issuecomment-993788883)\r\n\r\nIt seems the lack of support detection was the hang up that lead to an unsatisfied resolution in TAG.\r\n\r\nMy earlier remark that \"_browsers_\" didn't want to leak might be a mischaracterisation upon further reading. But the sentiment is the same, it was concluded that it was an undesirable compat trade off.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
